    "Name": "Grasshopper II",
    "Details": "Although called the Grasshopper II, this variant is just a modified Grasshopper used by certain mercenaries. It mounts a Large Pulser Laser and an ER Large Laser as the main damage weapons, with four Medium and two Small Lasers providing extra damage as needed. What makes the 'Mech stand out from other Grasshoppers is its large hatchet carried in the left hand.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Rugged</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.1</color></b>",
